/// Synopsis: the documented limits of the animations, each next to its way out where it has one: a `#pause` between the lines of a `>` box shows the box whole on the first step (its bottom edge lightly veiled) and holds back only what follows it; quotations on consecutive lines show on the first step as plain text in quotation marks, while quotations separated by blank lines are revealed one per step; with this theme, Touying's `#item-by-item` shows every item on every step. The other limits are tested elsewhere: "Unsupported mark" in `tests/errors/`, the covered content that runs on to the next page in `sections/pause-overflow`.
#import "../../common.typ": *
#show: setup
#include "body.typ"
